    "q-130529": {
      "dom_id": "step-q130529",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "Find $|{A}^{-1}|,$ if $A=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}].$",
      "worked_solution": "Given an invertible $n\\times n$ matrix $A,$ we have\n\n$$\n|{A}^{-1}|=\\frac{1}{|A|}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find $|A|$ using a Laplace expansion across the $2$nd column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|A| & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(-1)^{1+2}|\\begin{aligned}-4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}|+1(-1)^{2+2}|\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}|+(-1)(-1)^{3+2}|\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2(-12+2)+(9-5)+(-6+20) \\\\  & =20+4+14 \\\\  & =38\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain \n\n$$\n|{A}^{-1}|=\\frac{1}{|A|}=\\frac{1}{38}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-130529-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "-\\frac{1}{32}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"144\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-130529-b",
